        "fromEmail": "welcome@stratai.com",
        "toEmail": "={{ $json.user_email }}",
        "subject": "=Welcome to StratAI, {{ $json.user_name }}! 🎯",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <style>\n    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: white; }\n    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); color: white; padding: 50px 30px; text-align: center; }\n    .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 32px; }\n    .content { padding: 40px 30px; }\n    .step-box { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; margin: 15px 0; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #667eea; }\n    .step-number { display: inline-block; background: #667eea; color: white; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; text-align: center; line-height: 30px; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 10px; }\n    .cta-button { display: inline-block; background: #667eea; color: white; padding: 15px 40px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 30px; font-weight: bold; margin: 20px 0; }\n    .feature-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 15px; margin: 20px 0; }\n    .feature-card { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; }\n    .feature-icon { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <h1>🎯 Welcome to StratAI!</h1>\n      <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 18px; opacity: 0.9;\">Strategic Intelligence Powered by Multi-Agent AI</p>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <p>Hi {{ $json.user_name }},</p>\n      \n      <p>Welcome to StratAI! We're excited to help you make better strategic decisions with AI-powered intelligence synthesis.</p>\n      \n      <h2 style=\"color: #2c3e50;\">Get Started in 3 Easy Steps</h2>\n      \n      <div class=\"step-box\">\n        <span class=\"step-number\">1</span>\n        <strong>Ask Your Strategic Question</strong>\n        <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 40px;\">Enter a strategic decision you're facing - like \"Should we invest in AMD GPUs?\" or \"How do we prioritize customer allocations?\"</p>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"step-box\">\n        <span class=\"step-number\">2</span>\n        <strong>Provide Context</strong>\n        <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 40px;\">Share your market intelligence, strategic context, and risk factors. Upload PDFs if you have internal documents.</p>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"step-box\">\n        <span class=\"step-number\">3</span>\n        <strong>Get Your Analysis</strong>\n        <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 40px;\">Receive a comprehensive strategic report in Google Docs with confidence-scored recommendations from 5 specialized AI agents.</p>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\">\n        <a href=\"https://stratai.com/new-analysis\" class=\"cta-button\">🚀 Create Your First Analysis</a>\n      </div>\n      \n      <h2 style=\"color: #2c3e50;\">What You Get with StratAI</h2>\n      \n      <div class=\"feature-grid\">\n        <div class=\"feature-card\">\n          <div class=\"feature-icon\">🤖</div>\n          <strong>5 Specialized Agents</strong>\n          <p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #666;\">Market Data, Intelligence, Strategic, Risk, Competitive</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"feature-card\">\n          <div class=\"feature-icon\">📊</div>\n          <strong>Confidence Scoring</strong>\n          <p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #666;\">HHH evaluation shows analysis reliability</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"feature-card\">\n          <div class=\"feature-icon\">✅</div>\n          <strong>Cross-Validation</strong>\n          <p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #666;\">Agents validate each other's findings</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"feature-card\">\n          <div class=\"feature-icon\">💬</div>\n          <strong>AI Chat Assistant</strong>\n          <p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #666;\">Ask follow-up questions anytime</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div style=\"background: #fff3cd; border: 2px solid #ffc107; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 30px 0;\">\n        <h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; color: #856404;\">💡 Pro Tips for Your First Analysis</h3>\n        <ul style=\"margin: 10px 0; padding-left: 20px; color: #856404;\">\n          <li>Be specific with your strategic question</li>\n          <li>Provide as much context as possible (market data, internal constraints, competitive landscape)</li>\n          <li>Use the market signal sliders to indicate your environment</li>\n          <li>Upload relevant PDFs for richer analysis</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      \n      <p>Need help getting started? Reply to this email or check out our <a href=\"https://stratai.com/docs\">documentation</a>.</p>\n      \n      <p>Looking forward to powering your strategic decisions!</p>\n      \n      <p>Best regards,<br>\n      <strong>The StratAI Team</strong></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
